          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "The class has got a new dressing up box and Nellie is refusing to give up the police uniform costume. Gibbs decides to wear the Firefighter one and Buzz finds a stethoscope! Excited by their new outfits, the BrainBots set out to find the vehicles to match the job. They’ll go inside the vehicles that help people in emergency situations on land, air and even sea! ",
